<title>USA: Wall Street stocks mixed in early trading.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks mixed in early trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks were up a little in early trading on Friday, with a weak bond market inhibiting a follow-through on the previous day's late rally.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were up five at 6737 and the Nasdaq Composite was up fractionally at 1341.</p>
</text>
